{"id":"n3748e3468d","headline":"Key debt roundtable says it examined ways to mitigate risks of Total Return Swaps","summary":"A global sovereign debt roundtable said it discussed ways to mitigate the risks of Total Return Swaps, which participants said can significantly complicate a debt restructuring. The group oversees the G20 Common Framework.","why":"The Global Sovereign Debt Roundtable coordinates how distressed sovereign borrowers restructure debt under the G20 Common Framework. Derivatives that hide creditor exposures can make such restructurings harder.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Bangkok","country":"Thailand","lat":13.75,"lon":100.5,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"CNBC Africa","url":"https://www.cnbcafrica.com/2026/key-debt-roundtable-says-it-examined-ways-to-mitigate-risks-of-total-return-swaps"},"sources":[{"name":"CNBC Africa","url":"https://www.cnbcafrica.com/2026/key-debt-roundtable-says-it-examined-ways-to-mitigate-risks-of-total-return-swaps"}],"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:29:02Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"321cfee15fcc1f68","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-14T16:29:02Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-14T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"TH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-4174613.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"SatyaPrem","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/bank-central-bank-finance-4174613/"}}